8901,14.4,2012,62,119,24],[28902,14.8,2012,63,130,27],[28903,17.3,1960,65,134,25],[28904,21.8,1961,66,127,23]],"links":[["Weston County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/wyoming/weston-county"],["ARC or PLC in Weston County","/arc-plc/wyoming/weston-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Weston County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 17 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, the most of any pair. The open year 2026 started low on the middle, with January to February at 46% and February to March at 36% of normal. Grid 28000 had its driest year in 1960 at 52%.</p>"}
